Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分是客座讲座\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 is the guest lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:08.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它围绕一个小型机器学习项目 babykev 搭起同样的门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It builds the same gate around a small machine learning project, babykev,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:12.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,babykev 回答关于奶酪的问题，还会报告自己有多大把握\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which answers questions about cheese and reports how confident it is;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,纯粹的猜测应该得零分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a pure guess should score zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,直到最后才用到 Docker\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No Docker until the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:23.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先装两个工具，作为额外步骤：第 2 讲的包管理器 uv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two tools first, as extras: the package manager uv from lecture 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:30.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时是 0.13.2；还有命令运行器 just，1.59.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}0.13.2 at the time of recording, and the command runner just, 1.59.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 clone babykev，再列出它的 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Clone babykev and list its tags:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 9 步，课上每个阶段一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}9 steps, one per lecture stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 本身就是一套幻灯片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The repo is its own slide deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:41.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 git switch --detach 就能跳到任意一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and git switch --detach moves you to any step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:49.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 step-00，一条命令就建好环境：uv sync --locked\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At step-00, one command builds the environment: uv sync --locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:55.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它安装 Python 3.13.16 和项目本身，完全按 lock 文件写的来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It installs Python 3.13.16 and the project exactly as the lockfile says.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.07,0:00:58.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 --locked，意思是宁可停下，也不悄悄升级\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Locked means stop rather than silently upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:02.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时它打印的那条警告是无害的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its warning is harmless, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:04.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,前面 cheese 的 repo 冻结的是 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cheese repo froze an image;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.65,0:01:06.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 babykev pin 住的是 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}babykev pins a lockfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:09.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单独输入 just，会列出所有 recipe\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Typing just, alone, lists the recipes:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:12.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个任务一个名字，人、hook，以及之后的 CI 都用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one name per task, for people, hook, and later CI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把这些都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run these.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 step-01，加进来的是契约和它的测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 brings the contract and its tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:22.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行 uv run pytest：2 failed, 50 passed，而且测试是对的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run uv run pytest: 2 failed, 50 passed, and the tests are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:27.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个失败是纯粹的猜测被打成了一半的把握\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One failure is a pure guess scored as half confident;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:32.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一个是 77 个四舍五入后的概率，加起来只有 0.77\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the other is 77 rounded probabilities that sum to 0.77.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.74,0:01:36.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和 cheese 的演示同一条规则：改代码，不改测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same rule as the cheese demo: fix the code, not the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:40.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着 step-02：大规模的格式化和 lint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 is format and lint at scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:42.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,ruff 一个工具兼两个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ruff in both roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:45.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,格式化之后，linter 数出 70 个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After formatting, the linter counts 70 findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:47.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安全的自动修复去掉了一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Safe automatic fixes remove one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.18,0:01:52.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有意识地用上不安全的修复，又去掉 32 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unsafe fixes, applied deliberately, remove 32 more;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:54.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,剩下 37 个，这些得靠人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}37 remain; those need a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:58.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一部分的宽度之争，用一行就解决了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the width war from part 1 is settled in one line,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.95,0:02:02.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,line-length 设成 100，在 pyproject.toml 里只写一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}line-length = 100, written once in pyproject.toml;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:05.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,格式化工具和 linter 都照它来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the formatter and the linter both follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:10.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 step-03，用一个 recipe 装好门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 installs the gate with one recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:13.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,just setup，同步 lock 文件和安装 hook 一起完成\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}just setup: lockfile sync and hook install together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.23,0:02:15.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按 walk.md，下一条命令打印出这个 hook 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The walk's next command prints the hook file:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:21.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和前面一样的交接链，只有一处不同\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same hand-over chain as before, with one difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:25.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面写死了这台机器自己的 venv 路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This machine's own venv path is baked inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:26.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以它永远不会被 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it is never committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:29.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的配置只有四个 hook，不是九个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The config here has four hooks, not nine:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:34.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大文件、合并冲突标记、一个拒绝任何 .env 文件的策略 hook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}large files, merge markers, a policy hook refusing any .env file,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:37.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个运行 just check 的本地 hook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and one local hook that runs just check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.88,0:02:40.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 hook 跑的正是你自己敲的那条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the hook runs exactly what you type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:43.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这一步，just check 包括格式检查和 lint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At this step, just check means format check,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:47.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有带 90% 覆盖率下限的测试，以及配置文件的 lint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}lint, tests with a 90 percent coverage floor, and config linting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:53.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行 just check：全部是绿的，覆盖率 100%，高于 90% 的下限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run just check: everything green, coverage 100 percent over a floor of 90.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:58.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看它咬人：只跑 confidence 相关的测试，下限不变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now watch it bite: ask for only the confidence tests, keeping the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:02.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,9 个测试通过，一半的代码根本没跑到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}9 tests pass, half the code is never exercised,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:06.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次运行以 49.4% 的覆盖率失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the run fails at 49.4 percent coverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下限是门禁，不是目标\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A floor is a gate, not a goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.85,0:03:10.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:14.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置文件也要检查：hook 配置一坏，每次 commit 都会坏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Config files are checked too: a broken hook config breaks every commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:18.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 pre-commit 配置里缩进错一处\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One wrong indent in the pre-commit config,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,yamllint 就会指出具体是哪一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and yamllint names the exact line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.62,0:03:23.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,恢复之后，这个 recipe 跑绿了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Restored, the recipe runs green;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:27.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它还会校验 pyproject.toml，检查 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it also validates pyproject.toml and checks the lockfile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在门禁要拒绝了，两次；暂停一下，试试第一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the gate refuses, twice; pause and try the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加进一个没用到的 import\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An unused import goes in;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:37.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,commit 在 F401 上失败，没有生成 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the commit fails on F401, no commit made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:42.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着暂存一个 .env 文件，拒绝的理由就是配置里自己写的那句话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then a .env file is staged, and the refusal is the config's own sentence:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:47.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,.env 文件装的是一台机器的设置和密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a .env file holds the settings and secrets of one machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:49.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它永远不能 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is never committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:55.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两种门禁风格，都没问题：这个只指出问题，由你来跑 just fmt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two gate styles, both fine: this one points and you run just fmt;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:58.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,cheese 的门禁直接改写，再逼你看一眼\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the cheese gate rewrites and makes you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:02.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来 step-04 和 step-04b 把文档放进门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 4 and 4b put documentation in the gate:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:07.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一开始 88 个函数、方法和类里有 50 个带类型标注和文档\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}first 50 of 88 functions, methods and classes typed and documented,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:09.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一步是 88 个全都有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one step later 88 of 88;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:13.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉一条说明就会拦下 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}deleting one description blocks a commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.51,0:04:15.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,表里又多了两行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two rows join the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 step-05，模型来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 brings the model:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:24.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,setup 这个 recipe 现在会拉下整套模型依赖\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the setup recipe now pulls the model stack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:31.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,38 个包，包括 CPU 版的 torch 2.14.1，这是录制时的情况\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}38 packages including torch 2.14.1 for the CPU, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:36.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 just test：92 passed，覆盖率 94%，全绿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then just test: 92 passed, coverage 94 percent, all green.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:38.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两条都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:39.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个模型做什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does the model do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:43.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个请求把一段状态和几个问题打包进同一个序列\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A request packs one state and several questions into one sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:46.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个 mask 强制执行一条规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A mask enforces one rule:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:50.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个问题可以看到状态和它自己，绝不能看到兄弟问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a question may see the state and itself, never a sibling question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:55.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,问题必须各自独立回答；偷看一眼，就会把一个答案泄露进另一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Questions must be answered independently; a peek would leak one answer into another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:05:00.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一个禁止的格子，就是它和 causal mask 的全部区别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That one forbidden cell is the whole difference from a causal mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:04.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按 walk.md 打印出代码构建的 mask\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The walk prints the mask the code builds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:07.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个状态 token，加两个各有两个 token 的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for two state tokens and two questions of two;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:08.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，打印你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and print yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:13.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 行和第 6 行说明，问题 2 什么都能看到，包括问题 1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rows 5 and 6 say question 2 sees everything, including question 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因只有一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cause is one line:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:20.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,torch 的 ones like 把每一对 token 都标成同一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}torch.ones_like marks every pair of tokens as the same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:24.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个检查脚本把构建出的 mask 和我们想要的那个对比\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A checker script compares the built mask against the one we meant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在那几行打印出 WRONG\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and prints WRONG on those rows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可是 just check 里没有任何东西会运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But nothing in just check runs it;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:31.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,靠眼睛看的打印结果不是测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a printout you read by eye is not a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:37.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,branch mask 里每行代码都跑到了，覆盖率显示 94%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every line of branch_mask ran, and coverage reads 94 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有哪个覆盖率数字能抓到这个 bug 吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Can any coverage number catch this bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:54.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不能。覆盖率数的是跑过的行，从不管有没有人检查它们算出了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. Coverage counts lines that ran, never whether anyone checked what they produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:56.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,必要，但永远不充分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Necessary, and never sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:59.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同样绿着却看不见的，还有类型检查器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Also green and blind: the type checker,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:02.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它只读声明的类型，不运行代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which reads declared types without running the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:06.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行 ty，发现 6 条诊断，可 just check 还是绿的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Running ty finds 6 diagnostics, yet just check is green:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:12.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,类型还没进门禁，而门禁之外的检查谁也保护不了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}types are not in the gate yet, and a check outside the gate protects nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，在真实模型上跑冒烟测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, the smoke on the real model:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.73,0:06:19.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,5 亿参数，从 Hugging Face Hub 下载一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}half a billion parameters, downloaded once from the Hugging Face Hub,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:23.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是一个公开的模型托管平台，在 CPU 上回答 15 个奶酪问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a public model host, answering 15 cheese questions on CPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:27.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次运行要下载大约 1 GB；暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first run downloads about a gigabyte; pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:29.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,15 个里答对了 6 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}6 of 15 right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:33.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都没训练，这些都是猜的；先记住这个数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing is trained, these are guesses; hold that number.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:37.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 step-05a，用真正能看出问题的测试来回应\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5a answers with tests that could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先说实话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, honesty:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:43.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这台机器上，just test 显示 1 failed, 102 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on this machine just test says 1 failed, 102 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:49.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败的那个测试改动一个问题，要求其他问题的答案逐位不变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The failing test changes one question and demands that the other answers stay bit for bit equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这台 Linux 的 CPU 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On this Linux CPU,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:55.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,torch 求和的顺序和作者的 Mac 不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}torch sums in a different order than the author's Mac;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:58.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Mac 上 103 个全部通过，walk.md 里有记录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}there all 103 pass, as the walk records.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:02.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所谓 hermetic，是只有你的代码能让它失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Hermetic means only your code can make it fail;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.07,0:07:05.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跨机器逐位一致是一个更强的承诺\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}bit exactness across machines is a stronger promise;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:07.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这台机器把它量了出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this machine measured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:08.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在说正题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.85,0:07:13.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,故意放进一个错的修复：它只挡住紧挨在前面的那个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A deliberately wrong fix goes in, one that blocks only the question just before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:17.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,6 个 token 的图说一切正常；它看不出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The six token picture says all ok; it cannot tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:21.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,4 个 token 的图就能：它的最后一行显示 WRONG\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A four token picture can: its last row reads WRONG.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换个办法：把规则写一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}State the rule once instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:28.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,属性测试让 hypothesis 随便抽请求的形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The property test lets hypothesis draw any request shape:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:32.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,状态 1 到 6 个 token，最多 4 个问题，每个 1 到 5 个 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a state of 1 to 6 tokens, up to 4 questions of 1 to 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.85,0:07:38.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些尺寸一共允许 4686 种形状，多到没法一张张画图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those sizes allow 4,686 shapes, too many for pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.44,0:07:41.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它断言：任何被允许的一对，都绝不是兄弟问题的一对\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asserts that no allowed pair is ever a sibling pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:44.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑之前，先想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder before we run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你需要一个往回隔两步的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You need a question two steps back,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:58.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以是一个状态 token 加三个各有一个 token 的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so one state token and three questions of one token each.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 hypothesis 自己就找到了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And hypothesis finds it on its own:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:06.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一个测试失败，然后把反例收缩成正好这个形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the one test fails, then shrinks the counter example to exactly that shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:08.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,属性测试不只是说不；它还把最小的证据交到你手上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A property test does not only say no; it hands you the smallest witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.85,0:08:14.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来证明门禁长了牙\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Proof the gate grew teeth:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:18.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 step-05 那行错的 mask 放回去，再运行 just test\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}put step 5's wrong mask line back and run just test;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.05,0:08:19.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:24.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,8 failed, 95 passed；之前一路放行的代码，现在被拒绝了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}8 failed, 95 passed; code that sailed through before is refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门禁只能拒绝它的测试看得见的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gate refuses only what its tests can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:32.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真正的修复只有一行：同一个问题，意思是同一个 segment ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The real fix is one line: same question means same segment ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:34.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,类型检查也进了门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Types join the gate too:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:37.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的 recipe just types 通过了，check 现在有六行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the new recipe, just types, passes, and check has six lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:40.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那换上正确的 mask，冒烟测试呢？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the smoke, with the right mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:42.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,15 个里答对 4 个，比之前还低\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4 of 15, lower than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一下冒烟测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:48.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,之前的 6 是运气；没训练过的模型，分数说明不了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 6 was luck; an untrained score means nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:53.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了 step-05b，不 hermetic 的测试有了一个诚实的家\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5b gives non-hermetic tests an honest home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:56.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新加的真实模型测试标上了 system\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A new real model test is marked system,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:59.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置默认把这个 marker 排除在外\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the config deselects that marker by default:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:03.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每次 just test 都显示 1 deselected，这是有意的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every just test says 1 deselected, on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:07.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,明确要求时，just test -m system 显示 1 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Asked for explicitly, just test -m system says 1 passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:13.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,103 deselected：真实模型确实跑了，而且它必须通过，不能跳过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}103 deselected: the real model ran, and it had to pass, not skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:16.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是第一部分那次悄悄跳过的诚实版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is the honest version of part 1's silent skip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.84,0:09:18.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，两种写法都跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run both forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:20.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门禁里又多了几行小的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Smaller rows join the gate:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:23.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,hadolint 对 Dockerfile 做 lint，结果干净\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}hadolint lints the Dockerfile, clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:27.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分是在一台没有 Docker 的普通机器上录的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 was recorded on a plain machine without Docker,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这些 recipe 礼貌地失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the recipes fail politely:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:31.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker build 报 command not found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker build is command not found,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建 image 的 recipe 也会说明原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the image recipe explains itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你装了 Docker Desktop 的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On your laptop, with Docker Desktop,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 image 都会真正构建出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}both images build for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,剩下的看 walk.md 里的记录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The walk's record shows the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:46.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 lock 文件生成两个 image，1.15 GB 和 1.84 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two images from one lockfile, 1.15 and 1.84 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:50.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且 just check 在一个断网的 container 里也跑绿了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And just check runs green inside a container with no network:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,hermetic 的说法，用实验证明了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the hermetic claim, proved by experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:58.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,门禁表填满了：六行，系统测试在闸机外面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gate table is full: six rows, system outside the turnstile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再说局限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:02.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 hook 只在一台机器上运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A hook runs on one machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 git commit --no-verify 能直接绕过它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and git commit --no-verify walks straight past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:12.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 CI 在一台谁也绕不过的服务器上，把同样的检查再跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So CI re-runs the same checks on a server nobody can skip:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:15.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是同一个 repo 的 Part 5，第 21 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}part 5 of this same repo, in lecture 21.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也正因为这样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is also why the hook,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:20.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,hook、CI 和 README 应该用同一套写法来写这些检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI and the README should spell the checks one way;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,cheese 的 repo 还没完全做到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the cheese repo does not quite manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:27.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有人用同一条命令，这是你做 milestone 时要带走的经验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One command for everyone is the lesson for your milestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:31.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,覆盖率下限一句话说完：babykev 选了 90\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Coverage floors in one line: babykev chose 90;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:34.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,milestone 5 要求至少 70\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}milestone 5 asks at least 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:37.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾之前，先清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before the recap, clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的 Docker 清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's Docker cleanup:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.84,0:10:43.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,docker container ls 显示没有在运行的，所以不用停\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker container ls shows nothing running, so nothing to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是 docker system prune，输入 y\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then docker system prune; type y:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:51.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,清掉了大约 95 MB 的构建缓存，这是录制时的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}about 95 megabytes of build cache, at the time of recording.
