Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:12.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天没有任何计费：门禁就在你的笔记本上，这正是重点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing today was billable: the gate lives on your laptop, and that is the point.
