Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二题：系统测试在完全没有服务器的情况下也通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: the system tests pass with no server at all.
